null;\n    return nodeByPath != null && nodeByPath.isTextual() ? nodeByPath.textValue() : null;\n}\n```\n\n## Supporting method (extImpContextDataAdserver)\n\n```java\nprivate ExtImpContextDataAdserver extImpContextDataAdserver(JsonNode contextData) {\n    final JsonNode adServerNode = contextData != null ? contextData.get(FPD_ADSERVER_FIELD) : null;\n    if (adServerNode == null || adServerNode.isNull()) {\n        return null;\n    }\n    try {\n        return mapper.mapper().convertValue(adServerNode, ExtImpContextDataAdserver.class);\n    } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {\n        throw new PreBidException(e.getMessage(), e);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How it reads both sources\n\nThe `copyAdslot` method reads from two locations:\n\n1. **`imp.ext.context.data`** — obtained via `context.getData()` (`contextDataNode`)\n2. **`imp.ext.data`** — obtained via `imp.getExt().get(FPD_DATA_FIELD)` (`dataNode`)\n\nUsing `ObjectUtils.firstNonNull`, it checks four candidates in priority order: the GAM adserver adslot from the context data node, then from the data node, then the `pbadslot` text value from context data, then from the data node. A GAM adserver source only qualifies when its name equals `\"gam\"`. Once an adSlot is found, any leading slash is stripped and the result is stored under the `dfp_ad_unit_code` field.\n\nThis is Open Source Software from the Prebid Server project.", "durationMs": 14829, "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prebid/prebid-server-java/1.56.0/src/main/java/org/prebid/server/bidder/rubicon/RubiconBidder.java"}

